      "question": {
        ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $C$ given by\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & \\boxed{1} & -6 \\\\ 1 & -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIn terms of ${c}_{ij},$ the highlighted entry of the matrix $C$ corresponds to{{field-1}}.",
